uch more comfortable after a full day of screen time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJIuiAw5Sn_text","label":"ggJIuiAw5Sn_text","default":"Andrew J."},{"type":"html","id":"ggjqEGnqXa-_text","label":"ggjqEGnqXa-_text","default":"<strong>Great for All-Day Screen Use</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHQm-gHgnX_text","label":"ggHQm-gHgnX_text","default":"<p>As someone who works with screens all day, these glasses have been a real lifesaver. They’re comfortable to wear, and my eyes no longer feel strained at the end of the day.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL_IHawqBU_text","label":"ggL_IHawqBU_text","default":"Chloe S."},{"type":"html","id":"gg8ox97N8TY_text","label":"gg8ox97N8TY_text","default":"<strong>So Comfortable!</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrnVM_Sr0b_text","label":"ggrnVM_Sr0b_text","default":"<p>These glasses are so comfortable I can wear them all day without any issues. Plus, they really do reduce eye fatigue. I feel much more focused and my eyes feel less dry.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs4gKSJtfc_text","label":"ggs4gKSJtfc_text","default":"Steven L."},{"type":"html","id":"gghSOAh0kIJ_text","label":"gghSOAh0kIJ_text","default":"<strong>Made a Big Difference for My Eyes</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggc2ibKvMYJ_text","label":"ggc2ibKvMYJ_text","default":"<p>I spend hours on my laptop daily, and these glasses have made a huge difference. My eyes don’t get as tired anymore, and I don’t get headaches like I used to.</p>"}],
